---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Service & Service Level Agreement (SLA) | EU DPP Provider"
  description="Master Terms of Service, 99.9% uptime Service Level Agreement (SLA), Service Credits, liability limitations, and governing law for EU DPP Provider."
>
  <div class="py-16 sm:py-24 max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
      <div class="eyebrow-pill mb-3 mx-auto">Master Services Agreement · Version 2.4 (Nov 2026)</div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">
        Terms of Service & <br class="hidden sm:inline" />
        <span class="text-cyan-600">Service Level Agreement (SLA)</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
        Commercial licensing terms, 99.9% uptime SLA commitments, data ownership protections, and legal governance framework.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-8 text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">
      
      <!-- Section 1: Scope & Delivery Models -->
      <div class="neo-surface p-8 sm:p-10">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">1. Scope of Services & Commercial Delivery</h2>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
          These Terms govern the provision of the EU DPP Enterprise Software Suite (on-premise / private cloud) and the 10-Year Managed Sovereign Data Vault hosting services by EU DPP Provider to commercial enterprises (B2B), battery cell manufacturers, module packagers, and automotive OEMs.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Section 2: 99.9% Uptime SLA & Service Credits -->
      <div class="neo-surface p-8 sm:p-10">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">2. 99.9% Service Level Agreement (SLA) & Service Credits</h2>
        <div class="space-y-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600">
          <p>
            For Managed Sovereign Data Vault customers, EU DPP Provider guarantees a minimum monthly system availability of <strong>99.9%</strong>, excluding pre-announced scheduled maintenance windows.
          </p>
          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-white/80 border border-slate-200">
            <div class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Service Credit Schedule:</div>
            <ul class="space-y-1.5 text-slate-700">
              <li>• Availability 99.0% – 99.89%: 10% monthly service credit</li>
              <li>• Availability 95.0% – 98.99%: 25% monthly service credit</li>
              <li>• Availability &lt; 95.0%: 50% monthly service credit</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Section 3: Data Ownership & Zero Trade Secret Disclosure -->
      <div class="neo-surface p-8 sm:p-10">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">3. Proprietary IP, Data Ownership & Zero-Knowledge Shield</h2>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
          The Customer retains 100% exclusive intellectual property and ownership over all uploaded raw manufacturing data, BOM pricing, and proprietary chemical recipes. EU DPP Provider applies Zero-Knowledge Proof (ZKP) computation and cleanroom isolation; under no circumstances are raw formulation trade secrets transmitted or disclosed.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Section 4: Limitation of Liability -->
      <div class="neo-surface p-8 sm:p-10">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">4. Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
          Except in cases of gross negligence, willful misconduct, or statutory mandatory liability (e.g. under German Product Liability Law), either party's aggregate total liability arising out of or related to these Terms shall be strictly capped at the total amount actually paid by the Customer during the twelve (12) months preceding the incident.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Section 5: Governing Law & Jurisdiction -->
      <div class="neo-surface p-8 sm:p-10">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">5. Governing Law & Place of Jurisdiction</h2>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
          These Terms and any contractual disputes shall be governed exclusively by the laws of the Federal Republic of Germany, without giving effect to the UN Convention on Contracts for the International Sale of Goods (CISG). The exclusive place of jurisdiction for all disputes shall be Frankfurt am Main, Germany.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</Layout>
